// chorus — one module, several DSPs: each folder under engines/ is one, with its own panel.
// A node picks one with `engine:` and keeps its knobs per engine. `classic` is the default: Tracktion's
// chorus rebuilt as a graph, since the plugin's own knobs cannot be automated.
engine("classic")
// The blend is the engine's stage around the module, half wet as Tracktion's chorus was.
mix(0.5)
